WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Choose the local folder that holds your artwork and prepare its library. Once the first scan is complete, you can search with a reference image.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Check the usable file count in Library Management. Then return to the workspace and choose a reference image.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Compare the reference with the search results to find the artwork you need. You can compare similar designs side by side.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Looking for just one design? Select its region to reduce background distractions.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Search again with the selected region, check the match, then open the folder containing the artwork.
